(MUHYISSUNNAH DARS UKKUDA - ACADEMIC DIGITAL LIBRARY) '
(==================================================) '
(Subject: Islamic Jurisprudence \(Fiqh Shafi'i\)) '
(Book: Fathul Mueen bi Sharh Qurratil Ain) '
() '
(CHAPTER 1: PURIFICATION & SALAH \(Kitab as-Salat\)) '
(--------------------------------------------------) '
(1. Prerequisites of Valid Prayer \(Shurut as-Salah\):) '
(   - Taharah from Hadath \(Minor and Major impurities\).) '
(   - Cleanliness of body, clothing, and place of prayer.) '
(   - Covering of Awrah with suitable clothing.) '
(   - Facing Qiblah accurately.) '
(   - Knowledge of the entrance of Prayer Time.) '
() '
(2. Essential Pillars of Prayer \(Arkan as-Salah\):) '
(   - Niyyah \(Intention in the heart alongside Takbirat al-Ihram\).) '
(   - Standing posture \(Qiyam\) for obligatory prayers.) '
(   - Recitation of Surah Al-Fatihah with Tajweed.) '
(   - Ruku \(Bowing\) with Tranquility \(Tuma'ninah\).) '
(   - Sujud \(Prostration\) twice per rakah.) '
() '
(Reference: Shaikh Zainuddin Makhdoom as-Saghir \(R.A.\)) '
(Muhyissunnah Dars Ukkuda Official Study Repository.) '
